<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
	Only prerendered pages: these are real HTML for a crawler that does not run
	JavaScript. Agent and mission detail pages are client-rendered and infinite
	in number, so they are reachable through the site but deliberately omitted —
	a sitemap of URLs whose HTML is an empty shell is worse than none.

	The xmlns below has to be exactly the sitemaps.org schema, "sitemaps" with an
	s: with a mistyped one the file is well-formed XML but not a sitemap, and
	Google Search Console reports "Couldn't fetch" with no further detail. CI
	checks it (scripts/check-sitemap.py), because nothing else will.
-->
